    "title": "New 'luxury' cafe opens at Hoover library - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WBRC Digital Staff ,\n9 hours ago HOOVER, Ala. (WBRC) - A new luxury cafe is open at the Hoover library, bringing a collaborative cafe concept together for the community. According to organizers, the cafe is a collaboration between Tiffaney Strayhorne, owner of Pauline’s Fine Cakes, Desserts and Catering and Tierra Robinson-Jeter, founder of La’Fleur Coffee Botique. Read full article\n2",
